Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:02:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2000,2000)}"A Surprising Fact!\NThe Man Who Guarded the Sunny!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, it's hard to dig!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:02:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}SABAODY ARCHIPELAGO
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.59,0:02:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because this island is\Nmade mostly out of tree roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.38,0:02:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us, don't bury us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.30,0:02:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything, just don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain, Black, forced us to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.94,0:02:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we joined them, we thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.90,0:02:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...we could kill the Straw Hats...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...with high bounties...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.45,0:02:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...easily from within, as we like!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.96,0:02:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Drip!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop! He's gonna die!\NAre you a Devil Fruit eater?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.09,0:02:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.59,0:02:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I got him...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.81,0:02:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on here? Logia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.06,0:02:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But, look what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:03:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he just looked different\Nbecause I hadn't seen him for 2 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.07,0:03:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirate - Straw Hat...\NNo wonder! He was just a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.99,0:03:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think the gods\Nwill forgive them, Coribou?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I dig! I dig!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.70,0:03:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! Let's bury them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh gods! Let us bury these fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.13,0:03:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't! Please don't kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.17,0:03:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But I saw the real Straw\NHat Luffy for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.06,0:03:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you that I had no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.22,0:03:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}THE PLACE WHERE "THE FAKE\NSTRAW HATS" ASSEMBLED
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark King Rayleigh stood in our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.19,0:03:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He could even fight Uncle Kizaru equally\N- what would you expect us to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The Caribou brothers and their crew\Nand some of the fake Straw Hats...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.03,0:03:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...got away successfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.49,0:03:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We caught all the others
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:04:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but 2 Pacifistas were severely\Ndamaged by the real Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them was the prototype that\Ncornered the Straw Hats 2 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.67,0:04:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, his strength hasn't changed.\NSo they must have gotten stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.72,0:04:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They've improved themselves\Nin last 2 years, big time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.43,0:04:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to tell the\NNavy HQ in the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.15,0:04:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are completely revived!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.82,0:04:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gone before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.82,0:04:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gone before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey-chan and everybody,\Nthey all got stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,--Were you watching?\N--Yes, I'm a fan of theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're thinking about\Nsomething, aren't you, Ray-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.15,0:04:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Well... Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.27,0:05:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's a nice ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I stole it. My house burned\Ndown so I'm living here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? And what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.99,0:05:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.24,0:05:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Roger! I think we were\Ndestined to meet, Rayleigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Destined?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.75,0:05:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna turn the\Nworld upside down with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? The world?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.01,0:05:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you and where you from? Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.59,0:05:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ship is small but it looks like it\Ncan endure storms if you handle it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.61,0:05:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe nothing in this\Nworld happens by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.91,0:05:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,As everything happens for a reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,our destiny slowly takes form.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.33,0:05:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, Luffy looks great in that hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,better than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I want to live a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.76,0:05:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)}UNDER THE SEA NEAR SABAODY ARCHIPELAGO
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.43,0:05:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The surface is far up there already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:06:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What a view!\NSubmarines can't have windows this wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sinking and sinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop worrying about flooding!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.53,0:06:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels like we're leaving the\Ninhabited world. It makes me nervous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.28,0:06:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,C-C-Can we go back on the\Nsurface again for sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's not like I'm scared but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.16,0:06:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.13,0:06:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.31,0:06:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Trees... No, roots!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.48,0:06:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah! Come to think of it,\NSabaody Archipelago consists of giant mangroves!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.65,0:06:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm overwhelmed by the beauty of nature!\NI'm so surprised - my eyes could pop out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.99,0:06:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have eyes though!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:07:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen this already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.95,0:07:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, because you got on the wrong ship!\NShut up! Everybody's having a great time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe these roots are\Nrunning down to the sea bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.38,0:07:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They're enormous and magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.14,0:07:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hold it any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.01,0:07:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper...\NThere's something behind that tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.19,0:07:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How exciting! An underwater\Nadventure! It's like a dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.86,0:07:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.86,0:07:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.03,0:07:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I can catch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.62,0:07:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The fish here look delicious too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.12,0:07:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.83,0:07:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the bubble pops!\NDon't ever do that again or I kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-san, give us some dos and\Ndon'ts on the coated ship
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,before they do something stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:08:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Sanji-kun! Rayleigh-san gave me a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, everyone, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.18,0:08:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,She's moving! A real, beautiful woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.27,0:08:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.81,0:08:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,--It's gonna pop! It's gonna pop!\N--How can you fly that far with nosebleed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.61,0:08:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji flew out into the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The bubble doesn't break even under\Ntremendous pressure in this deep water
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but things can pass through it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.29,0:08:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.96,0:08:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel weak in the water...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.72,0:08:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.56,0:08:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to you, Sanji?!\NYou've become even more susceptible to women!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for him... What happened to this\Nladies' man - Sanji-san in the past 2 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, he's gonna\Nbleed to death once he meets
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.25,0:09:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the Mermaids\Nthat he's longing to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.71,0:09:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to call for blood\Ndonations at the Fish-Man Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Fish-Men and Mermaids\Nhave the same blood as humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.18,0:09:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The bubble that coats the\NSunny has the same quality...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.43,0:09:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,...as the bubbles at Sabaody\NArchipelago as we just saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.27,0:09:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop analyzing the bubble\Nin such a calm manner!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.44,0:09:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Robin's right.\NBasically, they're the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.15,0:09:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It stretches to a certain point and beyond\Nthat, it allows things to get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.16,0:09:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means if we fire a gun or a\Ncannon at a creature that attacks us,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.21,0:09:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the bubble won't break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Then, on what occasion\Nwill it break instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.59,0:10:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can imagine, when there are too many
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.61,0:10:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nholes at once, it'll break. For example,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.62,0:10:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,if we are bitten by a Sea\NKings' fangs, it'll be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.85,0:10:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They're fighting... We're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.52,0:10:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Or if the ship itself breaks up by\Ncrashing into a rock or a trench,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.03,0:10:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,the broken mast or planking will break\Nthe bubble and that also spells danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.03,0:10:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So we have to be careful with\Ncreatures and obstacles in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we don't do anything\Nfoolish from inside, it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I see! It's tougher than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.09,0:10:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But 70% of ships that head\Nfor the Fish-Man Island...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...end up sinking. So be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.84,0:10:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gonna happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.05,0:10:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,With my Gatling, I can catch\Na whole school of fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.10,0:10:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's see which of\Nus can catch more fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you guys listening to what Nami said?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.51,0:11:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,"Too many holes" is no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever try it again or I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.03,0:11:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! Hachi said he'd show us\Nthe way to the Fish-Man Island
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so I thought it was gonna be a safe trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.75,0:11:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They gave me a lot of lunches!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.88,0:11:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Sanji is sick,\Nlet's eat these, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so starved!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.34,0:11:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My bones are starved!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.26,0:11:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, the ship is gonna\Nbe stable for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.60,0:11:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't we have to do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.06,0:11:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope. We just have to ride\Nthis big sea current for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, we can continue\Non like this for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.40,0:11:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have much to do until later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we have a little time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.70,0:11:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something that I\Nhave to tell you all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.39,0:11:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,...The robot's secrets?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.39,0:11:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,...The robot's secrets?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.56,0:11:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You have more secrets?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.06,0:12:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What can you transform into?!\NOr you have a secret weapon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.36,0:12:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us, robot brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Super Armored Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.45,0:12:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.87,0:12:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's not about that-robo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.92,0:12:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, cool! He speaks Robotese!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.17,0:12:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what I wanna tell you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.72,0:12:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and eat while you're listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hachi told us that he would show\Nus the way to the Fish-Man Island
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but he got severely injured at Sabaody and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nhe's under medical care at Fish-Man Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.32,0:12:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He got injured for the same reason as Duval.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.99,0:12:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He had been protecting the Thousand Sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.62,0:12:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Around a year ago, the Navy\Nfound out about the Sunny
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.37,0:12:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and those two both faced fierce battles\Nand were taken out of commission.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:13:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Then how did the ship\Nremain undamaged after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There was someone else who fought for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There was someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.85,0:13:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who separated us 2 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The big Warlord - Bartholomew Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.77,0:13:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe my eyes when\NI got to the Sunny a few days ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.04,0:13:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.21,0:13:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't even a scratch on the Sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And Rayleigh told me later...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.61,0:14:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I work for the Revolutionaries army.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I have a connection with them,\NI wanna let them get away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you guys half expected that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.12,0:14:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.17,0:14:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And after we vanished from the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma-san visited Rayleigh and told him...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.09,0:14:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.97,0:14:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what made him obey the Navy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but he agreed to be a guinea pig and let
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.01,0:14:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nhis body be modified into a cyborg
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.68,0:14:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,piece by piece and he somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,lost his personality before the War of the Best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't think he could guess what
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.57,0:14:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,\Neach of us would do after we get separated!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so he waited for us at the\Nship without his personality?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.75,0:15:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He made Dr. Vegapunk, who modified him,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.85,0:15:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nagree to program a mission into his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,"Defend the pirate ship until the day that one of the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.45,0:15:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats comes back to the ship."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why, for the past 2\Nyears, without his own memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.39,0:15:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,he had been carrying out his own
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.15,0:15:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,\Norders, as a human weapon, waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.99,0:15:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.68,0:15:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did he do such a thing for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.78,0:15:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Terms like "connection,"\N"Revolutionaries army,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,remind me about Luffy's father - the\Nleader of the Revolutionaries army.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know my father that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.62,0:15:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But that bear-like guy was a good guy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no mistake that he's the one\Nwho gave us the past 2 worthwhile years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.52,0:16:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't even ask him why he\Ndid it but just remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.02,0:16:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Kuma turned out\Nto be one of our greatest allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.36,0:16:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if we meet him again,\NKuma is now a heartless human weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.16,0:16:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.16,0:16:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate what he did but\Nthere are still some mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope we can find out his motive one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.71,0:16:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,--Oh, you woke up, Sanji.\N--Eat lunch! It's from the Maiden Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Maiden Island? Is that\NKuma guy really an ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.72,0:16:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize where\NI was for the past 2 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.52,0:16:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of training were you doing\Nat the dream island full of women, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but let's enjoy the voyage now!\NDo you wanna sing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, Sanji-san, I don't\Nknow what you've been through
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.09,0:16:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to cheer me up! I feel pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.89,0:16:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, there he is. Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.97,0:16:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see that, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.40,0:17:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna join them this time for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,How deeply are we submerged now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.23,0:17:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting darker and darker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.83,0:17:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We went through the euphotic zone and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.74,0:17:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nwe're at the bottom of the twilight zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.71,0:17:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be more than 1000 meters below.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.99,0:17:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels different from submersibles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.77,0:17:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to start using what\NI studied on Weatheria for 2 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like flying in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.84,0:17:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Whale! There is a whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.95,0:17:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Whale! There is a whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.83,0:17:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,--Laboon! Laboon!\N--No, that's old man Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.93,0:17:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something at 6\No'clock! Is it a creature? No...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys all ready?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.60,0:17:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yes, brother!\N--Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.44,0:17:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The target is right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's easier to just destroy their\Nship and let it be swallowed by the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.70,0:17:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's no good because they\Nwon't know who did it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta cut their heads\Noff and bring them back
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.91,0:18:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,to show the world what Caribou is capable of!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.50,0:18:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not ready to fight!\NIt's a complete surprise attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.05,0:18:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make a mistake, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yes!\N--Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! There is a ship kind\Nof thing coming from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.35,0:18:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,--What?\N--A ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.94,0:18:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming towards us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.41,0:18:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,--It's a pirate ship!\N--They're pushing against us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away! The bubble is gonna pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.38,0:18:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No! They're gonna come through the bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.22,0:18:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.39,0:18:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard to port!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.44,0:19:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Sea Cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.65,0:19:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,--They're coming after us!\N--That sounds so familiar...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.45,0:19:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so persistent!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What do they want from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.46,0:19:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The bubble is gonna pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.91,0:19:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,--You're doing great, Sea Cow!\N--Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.21,0:19:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,--Are they gonna come aboard?\N--Sea Cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute! That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.05,0:19:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The bubbles are joined!\NBrother, now is the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.68,0:19:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,--Alright, should we do it?!\N--Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.31,0:19:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momoo! You're Momoo of the\NArlong Pirates, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.15,0:19:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Nami! I was there at the Arlong Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.36,0:19:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Hey, Luffy, doesn't he look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.24,0:20:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.66,0:20:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Die, you damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.95,0:20:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.54,0:20:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,--Let's board their ship!\N--Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.67,0:20:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! He's coming through the bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, somebody's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.64,0:20:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.72,0:20:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,--Guys! Are you ready?!\N--Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,While they're dumbfounded,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.03,0:20:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.28,0:20:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.12,0:20:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.20,0:20:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, follow my lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.00,0:20:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.96,0:20:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,--What's the matter, Sea Cow?\N--Why, Sea Cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.05,0:21:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,--Oh no, we left Captain Caribou on that ship!\N--Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.52,0:21:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, by way of greeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,fire the gatling gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.73,0:21:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill all the Straw Hats and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.47,0:21:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Don't throw me out into the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.61,0:21:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's something...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...you shouldn't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.45,0:21:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to value people's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.20,0:21:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The gods... the gods are watching\Nover you! Don't you think so?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being inconsistent!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.91,0:22:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you gonna fire a\Ngatling gun and kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.92,0:22:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that was just... That\Nwas just a play on words.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.01,0:22:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? You must be\Nthe captain of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.51,0:22:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Roronoa Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.77,0:22:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! I'm not a captain! I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.19,0:22:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I was forced to be a slave for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.28,0:22:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sick of being on that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.18,0:22:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's making ridiculous excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.22,0:22:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah! This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.88,0:22:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I stay on this ship for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.35,0:22:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.48,0:22:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he is kind of pathetic...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.02,0:22:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! He just made it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.73,0:22:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! He just made it up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.15,0:22:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where did you find the Sea\NCow who was drawing your ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.36,0:22:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.74,0:22:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is... mmm... Cutie-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.00,0:22:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the cat burglar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:23:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop looking at our navigator like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:23:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop looking at our navigator like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.13,0:23:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-san! You're safe...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.51,0:23:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.26,0:23:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's getting to be a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.76,0:23:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I just caught that sea monster somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.76,0:23:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I just caught that sea monster somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.31,0:23:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Experienced people have\Nthose animals pull their ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.44,0:23:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.77,0:23:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.24,0:23:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,--Stop! Stop, Sea Cow!\N--What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.78,0:23:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother! I'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.74,0:23:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna find a sea monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.66,0:23:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy! What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.42,0:23:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.80,0:23:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start his rehabilitation\Nwith some less stimulating pics.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.80,0:23:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start his rehabilitation\Nwith some less stimulating pics.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.89,0:23:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.89,0:23:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The direction we're heading is slightly off
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.33,0:23:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,from where Log Pose is pointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.85,0:23:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.77,0:23:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The right course should be south\Nwest of where it's pointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.44,0:24:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's faster to go straight.\NWhy should we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.19,0:24:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go straight, you'd be\Ntaken away by the sea current
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.62,0:24:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and get stuck by an undersea\Nmountain or volcano.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.08,0:24:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Volcano! It's\Nscary to be in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.75,0:24:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought the sea currents\Nin the Grand Line were volatile.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.79,0:24:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there any stable current?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.63,0:24:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.30,0:24:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is good. Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.05,0:24:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone! It's gonna get\Ncolder from here on out
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.11,0:24:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,so wear a coat or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.10,0:24:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's getting chilly\N- I can feel it on my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.27,0:24:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.40,0:24:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a skeleton--you don't have skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.23,0:24:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper-san, you can't do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.06,0:24:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't steal my line...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.82,0:24:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we going somewhere\Ncold? Not the deep sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.07,0:24:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that the\Nwater in the deep sea is cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.61,0:24:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Like in a bath tub, hot water\Ngoes up and cold water goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.83,0:24:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? I'm not a big fan of\Nbaths so I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.08,0:25:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.08,0:25:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.70,0:25:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If the sea is the same as a bath tub,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.92,0:25:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nit's gonna get colder as you go deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.98,0:25:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The temperature isn't the only difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.80,0:25:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still depressed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.97,0:25:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In the deep layer of the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.88,0:25:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,there are giant currents\Ncalled deep currents
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.43,0:25:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,that you don't get to see very often.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.52,0:25:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Those currents flow totally\Nindependently from surface currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.69,0:25:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There are currents under currents?!\NYou know many things!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.99,0:25:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm really old!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.61,0:25:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All currents are connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.37,0:25:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,One current flows eastward and\Nthe other one flows westward.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.66,0:25:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They could also flow upward or\Ndownward. It's like a giant dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.50,0:25:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep currents flow really slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.00,0:25:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they flow to the deep\Nsea, it takes 2000 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.51,0:25:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...until they flow upward to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.72,0:26:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,2000 years?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.31,0:26:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's why there\Nare a number of myths...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.02,0:26:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,about the dark and\Nundiscovered deep currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.48,0:26:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters! Curses! Spirits of the dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.65,0:26:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! There are ghosts in the deep sea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.28,0:26:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh? Really? I'm scared!\N--It's exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.37,0:26:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghosts... I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.25,0:26:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're gonna get on a downward flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.25,0:26:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're gonna get on a downward flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.59,0:26:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how we get to the deep sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.84,0:26:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So there are wonderful currents...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.06,0:26:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys didn't understand a bit, did you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.85,0:26:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna sing, Nami-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.48,0:26:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.33,0:26:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.87,0:26:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.25,0:26:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, I see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.17,0:26:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.09,0:26:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The wonderful current?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.17,0:27:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.76,0:27:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.55,0:27:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,--Oh!\N--What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.35,0:27:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's the downward current!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.93,0:27:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The downward flow--plume!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.27,0:27:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How... cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.15,0:27:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a massive...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.49,0:27:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,...waterfall in the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.49,0:27:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,...waterfall in the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.35,0:27:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is "falling" far below!\NAt an extraordinary speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.83,0:27:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.78,0:27:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nature's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.82,0:27:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What a spectacular stream!\NI wonder how deep it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.37,0:27:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's far greater than I had heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.54,0:27:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see the bottom! It's completely dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.97,0:27:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.70,0:27:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,With that speed,\Nwe're gonna be slammed
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.65,0:27:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,into the bottom and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.34,0:27:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really okay to go with the flow?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.80,0:28:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.85,0:28:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunny is the strongest ship built\Nfrom the treasure tree Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.73,0:28:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.44,0:28:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.78,0:28:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that it lives here...!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.08,0:28:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a demon that rules the realm of water!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.75,0:28:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And the enemy of the human race!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.69,0:28:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats! You should turn back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.57,0:28:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.37,0:28:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I had forgotten about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.20,0:28:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--There is a monster!\N--What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.13,0:28:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,B-Behind you...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.95,0:28:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? Cut that crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.43,0:28:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.64,0:28:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Be... Behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.15,0:28:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.48,0:28:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Kraken!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.82,0:28:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How huge!  The monster octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.82,0:29:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he broke a lot of ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.95,0:29:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ships that had left for the\NNew World have been attacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.87,0:29:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! I don't wanna die! Go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.87,0:29:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! I don't wanna die! Go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.37,0:29:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you just wait for a few days, it would...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.04,0:29:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.88,0:29:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.34,0:29:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's tame him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.90,0:29:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
